  "contentHtml": "<p>체세포 분열 수업을 할 때 학생들이 이해하기 쉬운 시각자료가 있으면 좋겠다는 생각에 만들어본 웹앱입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>수업하실 때 도움되길 바랄게요!</p><p>&#160;</p><p>ps. 제가 생명과학 전공이 아니라서 혹시 틀린 부분이 있을 수 있습니다! 있다면 댓글로 알려주시면 수정하도록 하겠습니다!!</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3086006eb4100bb06877fa9a5163a6ae84a5a671?download\" data-file-name=\"체세포분열_수업용_웹앱.html\" data-file-size=\"76261\" data-mimetype=\"text/html\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1449%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20260930131259&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F3086006eb4100bb06877fa9a5163a6ae84a5a671')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">체세포분열_수업용_웹앱</span><span class=\"type\">.html</span></div><div class=\"size\">74.47KB</div></div></a></div><p>&#160;</p><p>(추가) 수업하실 때 학습지도 있으면 좋겠다는 생각에 학습지도 제작하였습니다!!</p><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/d22baad04d4506a30d332b9a027207536953f1b9?download\" data-file-name=\"체세포분열_학습지_교사용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2089306\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHu%26dataid%3D1449%26fileid%3D4%26regdt%3D20260930131259&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fd22baad04d4506a30d332b9a027207536953f1b9')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">체세포분열_학습지_교사용</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">1.99MB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f22cd2f6eb9c55972800ff6a26316a6ace8ead6b?download\" data-file-name=\"체세포분열_학습지_학생용.pdf\" data-file-size=\"2072404\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grp